window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>From </b><b><i>USA Today</i></b><b> best-selling author Cora Reilly comes a new stand-alone forbidden mafia romance! What if you find your soulmate at the wrong time?</b></p> <p>Amo</p> <p>Do you believe in love at first sight? In a love so strong and bright, it ignites you even in your darkest hours? Do you believe that somewhere in this world there's someone who's destined to be your other half? Your soulmate?</p> <p>I didn't.</p> <p>Until I met her.</p> <p>Greta Falcone.</p> <p>Protected mafia princess from the madmen of Las Vegas, she's forbidden to me.</p> <p>Greta</p> <p>My love for my family and my animals was all I needed. I never thought I'd fall in love. Until I met him.</p> <p>Amo Vitiello. Future Capo of the Famiglia. Cruel and cold. The smiles that he has only for me quiet the chaos in my head.</p> <p>What if you find your soulmate at the wrong time?</p> <p>I knew the cruelest men, and yet nothing could ever be crueler than fate itself.</p>"; 
